1
00:05:56,666 --> 00:06:02,666
Jeffrey Dahmer murdered 17 men and boys between 1978 and
1991. This is the story before that story.

2
00:11:53,333 --> 00:11:59,333
My Friend Dahmer is a history, drama, crime film directed by Marc Meyers.

3
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:56,000
Jeffrey Dahmer struggles with a difficult family life as a young boy.

4
00:23:46,666 --> 00:23:52,666
During his teenage years he slowly transforms, edging
closer to the serial killer he was to become.

5
00:29:43,333 --> 00:29:49,333
Jeffrey Dahmer, played by Ross Lynch.

6
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:46,000
John 'Derf' Backderf, played by Alex Wolff.

7
00:41:36,666 --> 00:41:42,666
