11
01:05:23,333 --> 01:05:29,333
My Friend Dahmer is a 2017 American biographical crime drama film written and
directed by Marc Meyers about American serial killer Jeffrey Dahmer.

12
01:11:20,000 --> 01:11:26,000
The film is based on the 2012 graphic novel of the same name by cartoonist John "Derf" Backderf, who had been
friends with Dahmer in high school in the 1970s, until the time Dahmer began his killing spree in 1978.

13
01:17:16,666 --> 01:17:22,666
The film stars Ross Lynch as Dahmer, Alex Wolff as Derf, Dallas Roberts as
Lionel, Jeffrey's father, and Anne Heche as Joyce, Jeffrey's mother.

14
01:23:13,333 --> 01:23:19,333
The film premiered at the 2017 Tribeca Film Festival and was released
in the United States on November 3, 2017, by Hulu.

15
01:29:10,000 --> 01:29:16,000
The film received generally positive reviews from critics, who praised its historical accuracy and
Lynch's performance, but was a box office bomb, grossing $1.4 million worldwide.

16
01:35:06,666 --> 01:35:12,666
The film explores themes of high school, 1970s,
biography, based on true story, ohio.

17
01:41:03,333 --> 01:41:09,333
The tone is emotional.
